# The one-button mode in the corridor (src/one_button.zig), left button only:
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --ms 30000 --one-button --scene 1fquarbo --input tools/play/onebutton-corridor.input
#
# The floor near the bathroom door walks, the door itself knocks (its
# sound), a click on the parents' door walks over to it and a new click
# before the player gets there cancels it; the right edge leads back to the
# bedroom, and the bedroom door, clicked from the far side of the room,
# walks the player over and out.
0 scene 1fcorred 150 130 1 1 0
1000 click 530 400
+2500 expect 1fcorred
+0 click 548 338
+2500 expect 1fcorred
+0 log knock
+0 click 548 150
+2000 log parents' door, then a walk before arriving
+0 click 211 150
+400 click 400 400
+3000 expect 1fcorred
+0 state
+0 click 625 250
+0 wait 1fquarbo 10000
+1000 click 560 330
+3000 state
+0 click 95 80
+0 wait 1fcorred 10000
+1000 state
+0 quit
